              ┌─ Born under the stars ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
              │                                                                      │
              │  You were born on 11 Rainmoon 1415, in the year of the Water         │
              │  Kraken. You are 29 years old.                                       │
              │                                                                      │
              │  Could not leave the water, so swam the long way round by sea and    │
              │  arrived on the evening tide: strong and deep, and ungainly ashore.  │
              │  Rivers and the deep sea, that always find a way: clever.            │
              │                                                                      │
              │  A lucky day. Once in sixty years the Kraken is born of the water,   │
              │  and on the eleventh day it is born the Deep One.                    │
              │                                                                      │
              │  Grasping arms       A weapon in each hand hampers you less, and     │
              │                      with sword and shield your free bash comes      │
              │                      more often.                                     │
              │  Of the deep         Ice holds you as if you carried nothing, a      │
              │                      plunge through it never hurts you, and you      │
              │                      climb out onto it easily.                       │
              │  but Ungainly ashore Journeys across the land take you a little      │
              │                      longer.                                         │
              │  Always a way        Secret doors and hidden traps are easier for    │
              │                      you to find, and your searching reaches         │
              │                      farther.                                        │
              │  Drowning grip       What you strike, you hold: a creature you hit   │
              │                      in melee cannot step away until you miss it,    │
              │                      strike another, or move.                        │
              │                                                                      │
              │  Kraken: St +1  Dx −1  Wi +1   Water: In +1                          │
              │                                                                      │
              │ Enter continue   Esc back                                            │
              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
